   "xp": 333
  },
  {
   "copper": 5,
   "description": "Kesh Longstride has worn enough trail into those boots to know when trouble is moving. Go to Redtusk Outpost and speak to Kesh about what lies beyond the tallgrass. Listen closely; a scout should never have to tell you twice.",
