  {
   "copper": 16,
   "description": "The dry season is coming, and the tanners cannot work on empty bellies or empty racks. Bring eight pieces of Raw Meat and three Leather; hunt Waterhole Zebras in the Redtusk Tallgrass by day for the leather. Our hunters will thank us when their boots hold together.",
