   "xp": 315
  },
  {
   "copper": 23,
   "description": "I can read a trail, but these Ridgeback Tuskers keep ploughing tusk marks through it. Kill eight by daylight in the Redtusk Borderveld, in the east of Redtusk Savanna. Get them before a caravan finds out how little a loaded cart helps against a charge.",
